{"id":"458301","name":"蒸鸡蛋","author":"花生米608","authorId":"11473675","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/458301/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3个"}],"sub":[{"name":"熟青豆","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"南德调味料","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备三个新鲜的鸡蛋。","img":"images/458301/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"煮熟的青豆适量。","img":"images/458301/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"葱切小段。","img":"images/458301/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"盘中加入大半勺盐，半勺南德调味料。","img":"images/458301/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入两勺生抽搅拌均匀。","img":"images/458301/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"打入鸡蛋。","img":"images/458301/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"撒入青豆。","img":"images/458301/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"撒入葱花。","img":"images/458301/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"锅中加水烧开，鸡蛋上锅蒸10分钟即可。","img":"images/458301/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"关火后闷2分钟盛出，倒入少许香油即可。","img":"images/458301/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}